{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "8249ca7b-f78f-407c-8ba3-abfd226cc519",
		"name": "Laravel Order Inventory API",
		"description": "API Laravel + Sanctum.\n\nTiap folder = satu fitur. Request berlabel \\[ADMIN\\] pakai {{admin_token}}, \\[CUSTOMER\\] pakai {{customer_token}}. Request berakhiran '-> 403/401/422' adalah negative test.\n\nUrutan testing: 1. Auth (login admin + customer) -> 2. Products (create) -> 3. Coupons (create) -> 4. Orders (checkout, pay, cancel) -> hapus product/coupon paling akhir.\n\nPerhitungan checkout:  \nline_total = price_qty - round(price_qty\\*discount%/100)  \ntaxable = subtotal - product_discount - coupon_discount  \ntax = 11% taxable  \nshipping = 0 jika taxable >= 500.000, selain itu 25.000  \ngrand_total = taxable + tax + shipping",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "29296594"
	},
